"use strict";(self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_package_slips_doc=self.webpackChunkwoocommerce_package_slips_doc||[]).push([[713],{492(e,t,r){r.r(t),r.d(t,{_pageData:()=>s,default:()=>i});var a=r(641);const s=JSON.parse('{"path":"/woocommerce-package-slips/customer-experience.html","title":"Customer Experience Portal","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{"title":"Customer Experience Portal","description":"Understand how customers receive their PDF invoices through emails and how they download documents from the My Account orders portal."},"git":{},"filePathRelative":"woocommerce-package-slips/customer-experience.md"}'),o={name:"customer-experience.md"},i=(0,r(6262).A)(o,[["render",function(e,t,r,s,o,i){return(0,a.uX)(),(0,a.CE)("div",null,[...t[0]||(t[0]=[(0,a.Fv)('<h1 id="customer-portal-experience" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#customer-portal-experience"><span>Customer Portal &amp; Experience</span></a></h1><p>The plugin ensures a seamless post-purchase experience by delivering branded documents directly to your buyers. This guide details how customers access and download their invoices.</p><hr><h2 id="transactional-email-attachments" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#transactional-email-attachments"><span>Transactional Email Attachments</span></a></h2><p>When a customer completes a purchase or their order status changes, they receive standard WooCommerce notifications. The plugin inserts generated PDFs directly into these emails as file attachments:</p><ul><li><strong>Invoice PDF:</strong> Attached to the <strong>Order Completed</strong> or <strong>Customer Invoice</strong> email once payment is confirmed.</li><li><strong>Proforma PDF:</strong> Attached to the <strong>Order Processing</strong> email to serve as a preliminary payment receipt.</li><li><strong>Credit Note PDF:</strong> Attached to the <strong>Refunded Order</strong> email to confirm return details.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="customer-my-account-portal" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#customer-my-account-portal"><span>Customer &quot;My Account&quot; Portal</span></a></h2><p>If enabled in settings, registered customers can access and download their historical invoices at any time from their personal dashboard.</p><h3 id="_1-the-orders-history-grid" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-the-orders-history-grid"><span>1. The Orders History Grid</span></a></h3><p>Under <strong>My Account</strong> → <strong>Orders</strong>, customers see a listing of their purchases.</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pdf-invoices-packing-slips/images/woocommerce-package-slips/my-account-orders.png" alt="My Account Orders List"></p><ul><li><strong>Invoice Download Button:</strong> A dedicated link appears in the order table, allowing the customer to save their tax invoice locally with a single click.</li></ul><h3 id="_2-the-order-detail-screen" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-the-order-detail-screen"><span>2. The Order Detail Screen</span></a></h3><p>When a customer views the details of a specific order (<strong>My Account</strong> → <strong>Orders</strong> → <strong>View</strong>), a download link is positioned under the order meta summary header.</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pdf-invoices-packing-slips/images/woocommerce-package-slips/customer-order.png" alt="Customer Order Details Page"></p><ul><li><strong>Download Link:</strong> Clicking the <strong>Download Invoice</strong> button immediately serves the PDF using the shop&#39;s viewing mode configurations.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="sample-pdf-document-preview" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#sample-pdf-document-preview"><span>Sample PDF Document Preview</span></a></h2><p>Below is a preview of a standard, branded invoice generated by the plugin&#39;s template engine:</p><p><img src="/woocommerce-pdf-invoices-packing-slips/images/woocommerce-package-slips/package-slip-preview.png" alt="Sample PDF Document Layout"></p><h3 id="highlighted-elements" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#highlighted-elements"><span>Highlighted Elements:</span></a></h3><ol><li><strong>Company Branding:</strong> Displays the custom uploaded logo, aligned left, with corporate header details.</li><li><strong>Metadata Grid:</strong> Clean table listing order date, order ID, payment method, and legal invoice sequence numbers.</li><li><strong>Billing &amp; Shipping:</strong> Aligned side-by-side columns to separate payment responsibility from delivery details.</li><li><strong>Items Table:</strong> Item descriptions, quantities, price, and clear tax calculations.</li><li><strong>Totals Section:</strong> Detailed order totals with subtotal, tax breakdown, and shipping details.</li></ol>',23)])])}]])}}]);